<title>USA: Biomune's subsidiary Optim signs agreement.</title>
<headline>Biomune's subsidiary Optim signs agreement.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY, Utah 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biomune Systems Inc said Tuesday that its wholly-owned subsidiary, Optim Nutrition Inc signed an international distribution agreement to sell its nutritional dietary supplement, OPTIMUNE.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the deal, Optim Nutrition will begin shipment on December 1, 1996. The one year agreement is expected to generate over $1 million in revenues. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
